"doc":"Search for jobs based on the specified job end time and attribute. This method performs a search operation for jobs using the provided job end time and attribute. It returns the search results as a dictionary containing job details. Args: job_time: The job end time as a string (e.g., \"2024-06-01T12:00:00Z\"). attribute: The attribute to search for (e.g., display name, application ID). Returns: Dictionary containing the search results for jobs matching the criteria. Raises: SDKException: If the request is invalid or no jobs are found with the specified attribute. Example: >>> backupset = AzureAdBackupset( .) >>> results = backupset.get_search_response(\"2024-06-01T12:00:00Z\", \"displayName\") >>> print(f\"Total jobs found: {results['proccessingInfo']['totalHits']}\") >>>  Access job details from the results dictionary ",
