"doc":"Set this backupset as the default backupset if it is not already set. This method updates the default backupset for the associated client/application to the backupset represented by this instance. If the operation fails, an SDKException is raised. Raises: SDKException: If the backupset could not be set as the default. Example: >>> backupset = Backupset(client_object, 'UserBackupset') >>> backupset.set_default_backupset() >>> print(\"Backupset is now set as default.\") ",
