"ref":"cvpysdk.policies.schedule_policies.SchedulePolicy.update_associations",
"url":180,
"doc":"Updates the schedule policy associations Args: associations (list): List of schedule associations. operation_type (object): OperationType object (INCLUDE or DELETE). Usage: associations = [{'clientName': 'client2'}]  [{'clientGroupName': 'client2'}] sch_pol_obj.update_associations(associations, OperationType.DELETE)",
"func":1
