"ref":"cvpysdk.security.usergroup.UserGroups.send_request",
"url":195,
"doc":"Sends request to the commcell Args: method (str): HTTP method for the request url (str): URL for the request request_json (dict): JSON payload for the request Raises: SDKException: if response is not success Usage: self.send_request('POST', url, request_json)",
