"ref":"cvpysdk.subclients.casubclient.CloudAppsSubclient.additional_settings",
"url":205,
"doc":"Returns the AdditionalSettings instance for managing additional settings on this subclient. This property provides access to the AdditionalSettings API for the subclient entity, allowing you to add, edit, delete, and retrieve additional settings specific to this subclient. Returns: AdditionalSettings: An instance of the AdditionalSettings class for this subclient. Example: >>> subclient = self.agent.instances.get(\"instance_name\").backupsets.get(\"backupset_name\").subclients.get(\"subclient_name\") >>> subclient.additional_settings.add_additional_setting(  . key_name= ,  . category= ,  . data_type= ,  . value= ,  . comment= ,  . enabled=True  . )"
