"doc":"File for operating on a Azure CosmosDB Subclient. AzureCosmosDBSubclient: Derived class from CloudAppsSubclient Base class, representing a Azure Cosmos DB subclient(Azure CosmosDB Cassandra API,  ), and to perform operations on that subclient AzureCosmosDBSubclient: _get_subclient_properties()  gets the properties of Cloud Database Subclient"
