"doc":"Set the proxy to be used for IntelliSnap operations on the subclient. This method configures the specified proxy server for use with IntelliSnap backups on the current subclient. Args: proxy_name: The name of the proxy server to be used for IntelliSnap operations. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> subclient.set_proxy_for_snap(\"ProxyServer01\") >>> print(\"Proxy for IntelliSnap set successfully.\") ",
