"doc":"Enable backup operations for the subclient. This method activates backup functionality for the subclient, allowing it to participate in scheduled or manual backup jobs. Raises: SDKException: If enabling backup for the subclient fails. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> subclient.enable_backup() >>> print(\"Backup enabled for the subclient.\") ",
