"doc":"Get the last backup time for this subclient as a read-only property. Returns: The last backup time as a string, typically in a standard date-time format. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> last_time = subclient.last_backup_time  Access as a property >>> print(f\"Last backup was at: {last_time}\")"
