"doc":"Indicate whether backup is enabled for this subclient. Returns: True if backup is enabled for the subclient, False otherwise. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> if subclient.is_backup_enabled:  . print(\"Backup is enabled for this subclient.\")  . else:  . print(\"Backup is not enabled for this subclient.\")"
