"doc":"Get the unique identifier of the subclient as a read-only property. Returns: The subclient's unique ID as an integer. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> subclient_id = subclient.subclient_id  Access the subclient ID property >>> print(f\"Subclient ID: {subclient_id}\")"
