"url":205,
"doc":"Indicate whether IntelliSnap is enabled for this subclient. Returns: bool: True if IntelliSnap is enabled, False otherwise. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> if subclient.is_intelli_snap_enabled:  . print(\"IntelliSnap is enabled for this subclient.\")  . else:  . print(\"IntelliSnap is not enabled for this subclient.\")"
