"doc":"Get the storage media agent ID associated with this subclient. This property provides read-only access to the storage media agent (MA) ID for the subclient, which uniquely identifies the media agent used for storage operations. Returns: The storage media agent ID as an integer. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> ma_id = subclient.storage_ma_id  Access the storage MA ID using dot notation >>> print(f\"Storage Media Agent ID: {ma_id}\")"
