"doc":"Get the name of the plan associated with this subclient. Returns: The name of the plan as a string if a plan is associated, or None if no plan is set. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> plan_name = subclient.plan  Use dot notation for property access >>> if plan_name: >>> print(f\"Subclient is associated with plan: {plan_name}\") >>> else: >>> print(\"No plan is associated with this subclient.\")"
