"doc":"Runs a in-place restore job on the specified Sharepoint pseudo client This is used by Sharepoint V2 pseudo client Kwargs: paths (list)  list of sites or webs to be restored Example: [ \"MB\\https:  .sharepoint.com/sites/TestSite\\Contents\\Shared Documents\", \"MB\\https:  .sharepoint.com/sites/TestSite\\Contents\\Test Automation List\" ] Returns: Job object Raises: SDKException: if paths is not a list if failed to initialize job if response is empty if the method is called by SharePoint On-Premise Instance",
