"doc":"Get the snapshot engine name associated with this subclient. Returns: The name of the snapshot engine configured for the subclient. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> engine_name = subclient.snapshot_engine_name  Use dot notation for property >>> print(f\"Snapshot engine: {engine_name}\")"
