"doc":"Get the storage media agent (MA) associated with this subclient as a read-only property. Returns: The name of the storage media agent (MA) assigned to the subclient. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> ma_name = subclient.storage_ma  Access the storage MA as a property >>> print(f\"Storage Media Agent: {ma_name}\")"
