"doc":"Get the current status of software compression for the Subclient. Returns: bool: True if software compression is enabled, False otherwise. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> is_enabled = subclient.software_compression >>> print(f\"Software compression enabled: {is_enabled}\")"
