"url":205,
"doc":"Get the name of the subclient as a read-only property. Returns: The name of the subclient as a string. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> name = subclient.subclient_name  Access the subclient name property >>> print(f\"Subclient name: {name}\") >>>  The subclient_name property is read-only and cannot be modified directly"
