"doc":"Indicate whether the TrueUp feature is enabled for this Subclient. Returns: bool: True if TrueUp is enabled for the subclient, False otherwise. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> if subclient.is_trueup_enabled:  . print(\"TrueUp is enabled for this subclient.\")  . else:  . print(\"TrueUp is not enabled for this subclient.\")"
