"doc":"Get the properties of the subclient. Returns: dict: A dictionary containing the subclient's properties and configuration details. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> props = subclient.properties >>> print(props) {'subclientName': 'default', 'backupSetName': 'BackupSet1',  .}"
