"doc":"Unset the 'Use proxy' option for an IntelliSnap subclient. This method disables the proxy setting for the IntelliSnap subclient, ensuring that backup operations do not use a proxy server. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> subclient.unset_proxy_for_snap() >>> print(\"Proxy for IntelliSnap has been unset.\") ",
