"doc":"Indicate whether multiple readers are allowed for this Subclient. This property provides read-only access to the setting that determines if multiple readers can access the Subclient simultaneously, which may improve backup performance in certain scenarios. Returns: True if multiple readers are allowed; False otherwise. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> if subclient.allow_multiple_readers:  . print(\"Multiple readers are enabled for this Subclient.\")  . else:  . print(\"Multiple readers are not enabled.\")"
