"doc":"Enable IntelliSnap for the subclient using the specified snap engine. Args: snap_engine_name: The name of the snap engine to use for IntelliSnap operations. proxy_options: Optional dictionary containing proxy configuration options for the snap engine. Raises: SDKException: If enabling IntelliSnap for the subclient fails. Example: >>> subclient = Subclient() >>> subclient.enable_intelli_snap('VSA_SnapEngine') >>>  Optionally, specify proxy options >>> proxy_cfg = {'proxyHost': 'proxy01', 'proxyPort': 8080} >>> subclient.enable_intelli_snap('VSA_SnapEngine', proxy_options=proxy_cfg) ",
